  "text": "Create and manage personal medication favorites\n\nSave time during e-prescribing by building a personalized list of frequently ordered medications and instructions.\n\n### How to Create a Favorite\n1. Go to **Patients > Chart** and open the e-prescribing module.\n2. Search for and select your desired medication and dosage.\n3. Enter the preferred sig in the directions field.\n4. Click **Save to Favorites** in the action toolbar.\n5. Assign a custom label and click **Confirm**.\n\n### Limits and Conditions\n* Each clinician can store up to 150 items in their personal favorites list.\n* Shared clinic-wide favorites are managed separately through **Settings > E-Prescribing > Practice Defaults**.\n\n### Troubleshooting\nIf your favorites disappear following a software update, navigate to **Tools > Preferences > Restore Defaults** and select **Reload Personal Prescribing Lists**. If the list remains empty after reloading, contact the IT help desk to verify your user profile permissions."
 },
